		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=43542#p43542"><![CDATA[
I believe this is solved - it turns out that I was paying too much attention to the C++, and not enough to pybullet. From the pybullet docs:<blockquote class="uncited"><div>URDF_USE_SELF_COLLISION: by default, Bullet disables self-collision.</div></blockquote>Enabling self-collision gets me the expected collision set.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=13286">wbthomason</a> — Thu Aug 12, 2021 9:17 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
